ive — commission lane ''outfitter/lodge day-tour (dry season onl''","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":["hotel","guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Las Marías village + cacao/chocolate workshop","tier":"essential","source":"https://utopiaecohotel.com/ (Accessed 2026-07-06)","timing":"December-March","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Culture/Wellness cross-cut; Q''eqchi'' community + Utopia''s working cacao farm chocolate-making","si":"culture","blurb":"Culture/Wellness cross-cut; Q''eqchi'' community + Utopia''s working cacao farm chocolate-making","when":"December-March","commission":"lodge-run experience (Utopia)","accessed":"2026-07-06","wells":["stay","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culture","wellness"],"shelf_fit":{"culture":"primary","expedition":"destination","wellness":"evidenced"},"commission_lane":["hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane","si_raw":"Culture/Wellness","si_map_basis":"normalised from free text ''Culture/Wellness'' by gen_normalise_jewel_si"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to visit Semuc Champey?","a":"The dry season, November–April. That''s when the pools run clearest turquoise, the Cahabón current runs calm enough to swim and tube, and the now-paved road is reliably passable. Rainy season (May–October) can turn the pools muddy brown, spike current danger, and occasionally flood and close the site.","source":"adventurouskate.com, Accessed 2026-07-06","si_tag":"expedition","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What wildlife can I see near Semuc?","a":"The signature sight is the Grutas de Lanquín bat exodus, when thousands of bats stream out at sundown — an add-on guided tour via lodge or DMC. The wider department is Alta Verapaz cloud-forest quetzal country, with the Biotopo del Quetzal reserve on the Cobán approach.","source":"sallysees.com, Accessed 2026-07-06","si_tag":"wildlife","accessed":"2026-07-06"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Remoteness. Semuc is deep-rural: the nearest real hospital is ~4 hours away in Cobán, with no trauma center near the pools or caves, so evacuation-grade travel insurance is mandatory doctrine here. Also refuse dangerously overloaded 4×4 transfers (reports of 33 people in one truck) — book transport through a lodge or DMC.","source":"tripadvisor.com, Accessed 2026-07-06","si_tag":"safety","accessed":"2026-07-06"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Semuc Champey, Guatemala: Turquoise Pools, Caves & How to Visit (2026 Guide)","search_language":"en + es-GT","local_keywords":["cómo llegar a Semuc Champey","Semuc Champey mejor época para visitar","pozas turquesa Semuc Champey","grutas de Lanquín tour","cuánto cuesta la entrada a Semuc Champey","El Mirador Semuc Champey caminata"],"hreflang":["en","es-GT"],"jsonld_type":"TouristAttraction","content_freshness":"2026-07-06","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-06","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/guatemala","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:53Z","source_updated":"2026-08-13T14:45:16+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":["expedition"],"ultra":[{"play":"No true ultra exists; construct it — best eco-lodge (Utopia) or premier Cobán base + fully private guide + private 4x4 transfer, as one adventure day in a luxe Antigua/Atitlan/Tikal circuit","route":"Martsam (mid-luxury DMC) or Fora advisor lane for US ultra clients","manner_of_record":"sell privacy + private guiding, not a nonexistent resort"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-06","hero":{"query":"Semuc Champey, Guatemala"},"geo":{"lat":15.5342,"lng":-89.9539},"orbit":[{"id":"antigua-guatemala","jewels":12,"si":["expedition","culture","culinary","wildlife"]},{"id":"guatemala-city-guatemala","jewels":9,"si":["culture"]},{"id":"lake-atitlan-guatemala","jewels":11,"si":["adventure","romance","culture","wellness"]},{"id":"tikal-guatemala","jewels":9,"si":["expedition","culture"]}],"orbit_country":[]}'::jsonb, 113)
